# Screenshot the burner phone. Prints the saved file's path (under shots/).
# Usage: burner recipe screenshot
#
# For "take a screenshot of my burner" or "what's on my burner?" (the screen
# right now, not the installed apps): run this, then send the saved image
# itself back to the user.
# If your chat can't show files from ~/burner, use
# `burner shot --out ./burner-screen.png` to save into your working folder.
shot
